	(text "PIN BASLIGI (nRF24L01 modul dizilimi 2x4, 2.54 mm)\nDIKKAT: pin 2 = VIN 4.5..12 V (AMS1117-3.3 girisi), 3.3 V DEGIL.\nGiris lojik 5V toleransli (nRF24L01+). Ortalama akim ~15 mA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2b42e85b-16ea-58b1-afc6-a35c421834fd"))
	(text "nRF24L01+  (Nordic PS v1.0)\nEP (pad 21) Nordic onerisiyle bagli degil.\nC1/C2 = 2*CL - Cpcb - Cpin  (CL=12pF -> 22pF)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "58969bae-4327-56c9-8c85-33c88952badc"))
	(text "Balun + harmonik filtre: hazir Johanson 2450BM14A0002 (B1)\nAyrik L/C eslestirme (Nordic Sekil 32) yerine tek parca.\nANT2 -> 3, ANT1 -> 4 simetrik ve kisa; VDD_PA -> 5 (DC besleme) + C3 2.2nF.\nCikis (1) 50 ohm; IL <= 2 dB, 2fo/3fo >= 15 dB.\nC4/L1/C5 chip anten pi eslestirme yeri (kartta VNA ile ayarlanir)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 129.54 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c081b406-5488-54c1-a82b-d5262a82b9ed"))
	(text "Besleme: AMS1117-3.3 (U2)\nVIN 4.5..12 V -> +3V3. C11 tantal (ESR kararlilik icin)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 81.28 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b3b4162a-98e3-585b-9dda-fff2310c9b0e"))
